  "description": "<p data-start=\"63\" data-end=\"137\"><strong data-start=\"63\" data-end=\"137\">Drie legendarische Mario-avonturen in één verzameling – In Nette Staat</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"139\" data-end=\"495\"><em data-start=\"139\" data-end=\"165\">Super Mario 3D All-Stars</em> bundelt drie van de meest geliefde 3D-platformers ooit gemaakt: <strong data-start=\"230\" data-end=\"248\">Super Mario 64</strong>, <strong data-start=\"250\" data-end=\"274\">Super Mario Sunshine</strong> en <strong data-start=\"278\" data-end=\"300\">Super Mario Galaxy</strong>. Elk van deze klassiekers is geoptimaliseerd voor Nintendo Switch en biedt verbeterde resolutie, soepelere prestaties en moderne besturing — terwijl de charme en magie volledig behouden blijven.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"497\" data-end=\"810\">Of je nu nostalgisch terugkeert naar de iconische werelden van Mario 64, de zonovergoten eilanden van Sunshine of de intergalactische avonturen van Galaxy, deze collectie zit bomvol variatie, uitdagingen en pure speelsheid. Perfect voor zowel nieuwe spelers als fans die deze meesterwerken opnieuw willen beleven.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"812\" data-end=\"880\"><strong data-start=\"812\" data-end=\"880\">Waarom deze collectie een must-have is voor elke Switch-bezitter</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"882\" data-end=\"1263\">\r\n<li data-start=\"882\" data-end=\"940\">\r\n<p data-start=\"884\" data-end=\"940\">⭐ Bevat drie volledige Mario-klassiekers in één pakket</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"941\" data-end=\"999\">\r\n<p data-start=\"943\" data-end=\"999\">🎮 Verbeterde resolutie en geoptimaliseerde prestaties</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1000\" data-end=\"1061\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1002\" data-end=\"1061\">🌎 Enorme variatie aan werelden, puzzels en platformactie</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1062\" data-end=\"1122\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1064\" data-end=\"1122\">🎵 Inclusief soundtrack-selecties van alle drie de games</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1123\" data-end=\"1191\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1125\" data-end=\"1191\">🎯 Toegankelijk voor beginners én uitdagend voor ervaren spelers</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1192\" data-end=\"1244\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1194\" data-end=\"1244\">🧱 <strong data-start=\"1197\" data-end=\"1216\">Losse cartridge</strong> (geen doosje meegeleverd)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1245\" data-end=\"1263\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1247\" data-end=\"1263\">✨ In Nette Staat</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1265\" data-end=\"1268\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1270\" data-end=\"1294\">📋 <strong data-start=\"1277\" data-end=\"1294\">Specificaties</strong></h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex w-fit flex-col-reverse\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1296\" data-end=\"1602\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1296\" data-end=\"1320\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1296\" data-end=\"1320\">\r\n<th data-start=\"1296\" data-end=\"1309\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Eigenschap</th>\r\n<th data-start=\"1309\" data-end=\"1320\" data-col-size=\"md\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1345\" data-end=\"1602\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1345\" data-end=\"1382\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1345\" data-end=\"1358\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Soort game</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1358\" data-end=\"1382\">3D-platformcollectie</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1383\" data-end=\"1413\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1383\" data-end=\"1394\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Platform</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1394\" data-end=\"1413\">Nintendo Switch</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1414\" data-end=\"1493\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1414\" data-end=\"1433\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Inbegrepen games</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1433\" data-end=\"1493\">Super Mario 64, Super Mario Sunshine, Super Mario Galaxy</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1494\" data-end=\"1523\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1494\" data-end=\"1507\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Speelmodus</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1507\" data-end=\"1523\">Singleplayer</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1524\" data-end=\"1575\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1524\" data-end=\"1538\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Meegeleverd</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1538\" data-end=\"1575\"><strong data-start=\"1540\" data-end=\"1573\">Losse cartridge (geen doosje)</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1576\" data-end=\"1602\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1576\" data-end=\"1584\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Staat</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1584\" data-end=\"1602\" data-col-size=\"md\">In Nette Staat</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1604\" data-end=\"1607\">\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1609\" data-end=\"1645\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"1609\" data-end=\"1645\" data-is-last-node=\"\">Incl. Garantie: 1 maand garantie</strong></p>",
